Negative control for the SANITIZED-HTML body cell (FE-3091 operator
refinement 2).

Swaps the `Sanitized` render for a plain text interpolation, so a `body`
declared as `TableCellHtml` is drawn as ESCAPED TEXT — its markup shown as
literal tags rather than rendered as sanitized HTML. This is the exact failure
the refinement closes: an email body is markup, never plain text.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the html-cell spec — a `TableCellHtml` field must render its value as
sanitized markup (drawn through the ui `Sanitized` component / dompurify),
never as escaped text and never as raw unsanitized HTML.

